{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_Remark_Usage_of_CanIf_SetPduMode","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_CANStateManager","page":101,"text":"8.6.1.1 Remark: Usage of CanIf_SetPduMode\nAlthough the CanIf module provides more requestable PDU modes, the CanSM mod-\nule only uses the parameters CANIF_ONLINE, CANIF_TX_OFFLINE_ACTIVE and\nCANIF_TX_OFFLINE for the call of the API CanIf_SetPduMode.\nThe CANIF_OFFLINE mode is assumed automatically by CanIf and needs not to be\nset by CanSM.","caption":"8.6.1.1 Remark: Usage of CanIf_SetPduMode","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_Remark_Usage_of_CanIf_SetPduMode","releases":["R23-11"],"page":99,"hash":"a5f23f0a36df82aa","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_COMM_SECTION_8_6_1_1_Remark_Usage_of_CanIf_SetPduMode","releases":["R24-11"],"page":101,"hash":"d883b4439969bf2d","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R23-11","R24-11"],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00008"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.8,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"PDU modes used in CanIf_SetPduMode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00137"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.7,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"CanIf assumes CANIF_OFFLINE mode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00864"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.7,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"CanSM calling CanIf_SetPduMode with CANIF_ONLINE","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CanSM_00539"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}